#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:188
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:190
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs both Prefill and Decode on the same node. It is "
"suitable for functional validation, long-context single-cluster serving, and"
" W8A8 deployment on 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB x 16) node. The W8A8 version needs "
"`--quantization ascend`."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一节点上运行Prefill和Decode。它适用于功能验证、长上下文单集群服务，以及在1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB x "
"16）节点上的W8A8部署。W8A8版本需要`--quantization ascend`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:199
msgid ""
"Run the following script to execute online inference on 1 Ascend 950DT (96GB"
" x 8). The quantized versions (`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mxfp8` and "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`) can be deployed on a single Ascend 950DT "
"node."
msgstr ""
"运行以下脚本在1个Ascend 950DT（96GB x "
"8）上执行在线推理。量化版本（`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mxfp8`和`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`）可以部署在单个Ascend"
" 950DT节点上。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:248
msgid ""
"Run the following script to execute online 128K inference on 1 Atlas 800 A3 "
"(64GB x 16)."
msgstr "运行以下脚本以在1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB x 16）上执行在线128K推理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:294
msgid ""
"For W8A8 deployment, 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB x 8) nodes are required. Refer to "
"[Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-deployment-with-mp-recommended) for multi-node "
"MP deployment."
msgstr ""
"对于W8A8部署，需要2个Atlas 800 A2（64GB x 8）节点。请参阅[第5.2节](#52-multi-node-deployment-"
"with-mp-recommended)了解多节点MP部署。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:298
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the service fails to start, HBM is insufficient, or "
"requests are not scheduled as expected, refer to [FAQs](../../faqs.md) "
"first, and then check the model-specific FAQ in Section 10."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果服务启动失败、HBM 不足或请求未按预期调度，请先参考[常见问题解答](../../faqs.md)，然后查看第 10 节中的模型特定"
" FAQ。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:300
msgid "**Key parameters:**"
msgstr "**关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:302
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size 1` and `--tensor-parallel-size 16` set DP and TP for "
"one 16-NPU A3 node."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 16` 为一个 16-NPU A3 节点设置 DP"
" 和 TP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:303
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。不要在同一个 MoE 层中混合使用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:304
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` is the maximum input plus output length for a single "
"request. Increase it only when enough KV cache is available."
msgstr "`--max-model-len` 是单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。仅在拥有足够 KV 缓存时增加此值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:305
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` is the maximum number of active requests scheduled by each "
"DP group. For performance tests, set `--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-size`"
" greater than or equal to the test concurrency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` 是每个 DP 组调度的最大活动请求数。对于性能测试，请将 `--max-num-seqs * --data-"
"parallel-size` 设置为大于或等于测试并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:306
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` 是一个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高预填充效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:307
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls how much HBM vLLM can use to calculate "
"KV cache capacity. A higher value increases KV cache size but can trigger "
"OOM if runtime memory is higher than the profile run."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制 vLLM 可用于计算 KV 缓存容量的 HBM 比例。较高的值会增加 KV "
"缓存大小，但如果运行时内存高于 profile 运行，则可能触发 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:308
msgid ""
"`--enable-prefix-caching` enables prefix caching. For Qwen3.5, short "
"prefixes may not be cached when the hybrid KV cache manager adjusts the "
"block size to a large value."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-prefix-caching` 启用前缀缓存。对于 Qwen3.5，当混合 KV "
"缓存管理器将块大小调整为较大值时，短前缀可能不会被缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:309
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model. "
"Remove this option when deploying the BF16 model."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend` 启用 W8A8 模型的昇腾量化。部署 BF16 模型时请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:310
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config` enables Qwen3.5 MTP speculative decoding. Reduce "
"`num_speculative_tokens` or remove this option if the workload is sensitive "
"to first-token latency or if MTP is unstable in your environment."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config` 启用 Qwen3.5 MTP 推测解码。如果工作负载对首 token 延迟敏感，或 MTP "
"在您的环境中不稳定，请减少 `num_speculative_tokens` 或移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:311
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode ACLGraph replay to reduce dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 启用完整解码 "
"ACLGraph 重放以减少调度开销。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:312
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. "
"`enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config`启用Ascend特定优化。`enable_cpu_binding`启用Ascend原生CPU绑定。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:314
msgid "5.2 Multi-Node Deployment with MP (Recommended)"
msgstr "5.2 基于 MP 的多节点部署（推荐）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:316
msgid ""
"Multi-node MP deployment uses vLLM data parallelism across nodes and tensor "
"parallelism within each node. It is recommended for the W8A8 model on 2 "
"Atlas 800 A2 (64GB x 8) nodes."
msgstr ""
"多节点MP部署在节点间使用vLLM数据并行，在节点内使用张量并行。推荐用于2个Atlas 800 A2（64GB x 8）节点上的W8A8模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:318
msgid ""
"Assume you have 2 Atlas 800 A2 nodes and want to deploy "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp` across them. Replace `nic_name`, `local_ip`, "
"and `node0_ip` with the actual network interface and IP addresses in your "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"假设您有 2 个 Atlas 800 A2 节点，并希望跨节点部署 `Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp`。请将 "
"`nic_name`、`local_ip` 和 `node0_ip` 替换为您环境中的实际网络接口和 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:320
msgid "Run the following script on node 0."
msgstr "在节点 0 上运行以下脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:366
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If node 1 cannot join the service or HCCL initialization "
"times out, refer to [verify multi-node communication "
"environment](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-communication) and "
"[FAQs](../../faqs.md). Make sure the network interface names, IP addresses, "
"and RPC ports are consistent across nodes."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果节点 1 无法加入服务或 HCCL "
"初始化超时，请参考[验证多节点通信环境](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-"
"communication)和[常见问题](../../faqs.md)。确保各节点的网络接口名称、IP 地址和 RPC 端口一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:368
msgid "Run the following script on node 1."
msgstr "在节点 1 上运行以下脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:418
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the headless node exits immediately, check whether "
"node 0 is already running, whether `--data-parallel-address` points to node "
"0, and whether `--data-parallel-start-rank` is unique for each node."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果无头节点立即退出，请检查节点 0 是否已在运行、`--data-parallel-address` 是否指向节点 0，以及每个节点的 "
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` 是否唯一。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:420
msgid ""
"If the service starts successfully, the following information is displayed "
"on node 0:"
msgstr "如果服务启动成功，节点 0 上将显示以下信息："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:431
msgid "**Key parameters for MP deployment:**"
msgstr "**MP 部署的关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:433
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size` is the global DP size across all nodes. In the "
"example, 2 DP ranks are used."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size` 是所有节点的全局 DP 大小。示例中使用了 2 个 DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:434
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local` is the number of DP ranks on the current node. "
"In the example, each A2 node has 1 local DP rank."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local` 是当前节点上的 DP rank 数量。示例中每个 A2 节点有 1 个本地 DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:435
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` is the first DP rank on the current node. Node "
"0 starts from 0 by default, and node 1 starts from 1."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` 是当前节点上的起始 DP rank。节点 0 默认从 0 开始，节点 1 从 1 开始。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:436
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address` must point to the master DP node. Use node 0 "
"`local_ip` on node 0 and `node0_ip` on other nodes."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-address` 必须指向主 DP 节点。在节点 0 上使用节点 0 的 `local_ip`，在其他节点上使用 "
"`node0_ip`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:437
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all "
"nodes and ensure the port is available."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port` 是 DP RPC 端口。在所有节点上使用相同的值，并确保端口可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:438
msgid ""
"`--api-server-count` controls how many API server processes are started on "
"the master node."
msgstr "`--api-server-count` 控制主节点上启动的 API 服务器进程数量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:439
msgid ""
"`--headless` starts a worker node without exposing an API server. Use it on "
"non-master nodes."
msgstr "`--headless` 启动一个不暴露 API 服务器的工作节点。在非主节点上使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:440
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 8` maps one TP group to the 8 NPUs on each A2 node."
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 8` 将一个 TP 组映射到每个 A2 节点上的 8 个 NPU。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:441
msgid ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` bind HCCL, Gloo, and TP communication to the selected "
"network."
msgstr ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` "
"将 HCCL、Gloo 和 TP 通信绑定到所选网络。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:442
msgid ""
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for "
"better throughput on MoE workloads."
msgstr "`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算，以在 MoE 工作负载上获得更好的吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:444
msgid "5.3 Multi-Node Deployment with Ray"
msgstr "5.3 基于 Ray 的多节点部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:446
msgid ""
"For Ray-based distributed deployment, refer to [Ray Distributed "
"(Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B)](../features/ray.md). The same model weight, "
"communication verification, and parameter tuning principles apply to "
"Qwen3.5-397B-A17B."
msgstr ""
"对于基于 Ray 的分布式部署，请参考 [Ray 分布式 "
"(Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B)](../features/ray.md)。相同的模型权重、通信验证和参数调优原则适用于 "
"Qwen3.5-397B-A17B。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:448
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If Ray workers cannot discover each other, check Ray "
"cluster status first, then verify the same HCCL and network interface "
"settings used in MP deployment."
msgstr "常见问题提示：如果 Ray 工作节点无法相互发现，请先检查 Ray 集群状态，然后验证 MP 部署中使用的相同 HCCL 和网络接口设置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:450
msgid "5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A3)"
msgstr "5.4 预填充-解码分离（A3）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:452
msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service "
"groups. Prefill nodes process large prompt chunks, Decode nodes serve token "
"generation, and a proxy forwards requests between them. This mode is "
"suitable for production serving scenarios where prefill and decode resource "
"ratios need to be tuned separately."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离将预填充和解码划分为不同的服务组。预填充节点处理大块提示，解码节点负责 token "
"生成，代理在两者之间转发请求。此模式适用于需要分别调整预填充和解码资源比例的生产服务场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:454
msgid ""
"We recommend using Mooncake for deployment. Refer to "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"general PD disaggregation workflow."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 Mooncake 进行部署。有关通用 PD 分离工作流程，请参考 "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:456
msgid ""
"For Atlas 800 A3 (64GB x 16), we recommend deploying 1P1D with 2 nodes for "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp`:"
msgstr ""
"对于Atlas 800 A3（64GB x 16），我们建议使用2个节点部署1P1D以运行`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:458
msgid "1 Prefill node: 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB x 16)."
msgstr "1个Prefill节点：1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB x 16）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:459
msgid "1 Decode node: 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB x 16)."
msgstr "1个解码节点：1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB x 16）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:461
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:639
msgid ""
"Deploy `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh` on the corresponding nodes, and deploy a "
"proxy script on the prefill master node to forward requests."
msgstr "在相应节点上部署`run_p.sh`和`run_d.sh`，并在预填充主节点上部署代理脚本以转发请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:463
msgid "5.4.1 Prefill Node"
msgstr "5.4.1 预填充节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:465
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:643
msgid "Create `run_p.sh` on the prefill node."
msgstr "在预填充节点上创建 `run_p.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:537
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the prefill service is not ready for a long time, "
"check whether the model path is shared, `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` contains"
" all 16 NPUs, and the Mooncake `kv_port` is available."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果预填充服务长时间未就绪，请检查模型路径是否共享、`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 是否包含全部 16 个 "
"NPU，以及 Mooncake `kv_port` 是否可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:539
msgid "5.4.2 Decode Node"
msgstr "5.4.2 解码节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:541
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:726
msgid "Create `run_d.sh` on the decode node."
msgstr "在解码节点上创建`run_d.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:614
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the decode node fails to initialize, check that "
"`--tensor-parallel-size` is 16, `--data-parallel-size-local` matches the "
"global decode DP size (1), and `kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size` "
"matches the global decode DP size."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果解码节点初始化失败，请检查`--tensor-parallel-size`是否为16，`--data-parallel-size-"
"local`是否与全局解码DP大小（1）匹配，以及`kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size`是否与全局解码DP大小匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:616
msgid "**Key parameters for PD disaggregation:**"
msgstr "**PD分离的关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:618
msgid ""
"`--distributed-executor-backend mp` uses multiprocessing on each node for "
"the local workers."
msgstr "`--distributed-executor-backend mp`在每个节点上使用多进程处理本地工作节点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:619
msgid ""
"Prefill uses `--data-parallel-size 1`, `--data-parallel-size-local 1`, and "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 16`. This creates 1 DP group with TP16."
msgstr ""
"预填充使用`--data-parallel-size 1`、`--data-parallel-size-local 1`和`--tensor-"
"parallel-size 16`。这将创建1个DP组，每组TP16。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:620
msgid ""
"Decode uses `--data-parallel-size 1`, `--data-parallel-size-local 1`, and "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 16`. This creates 1 local DP groups, each with TP16 "
"."
msgstr ""
"解码使用`--data-parallel-size 1`、`--data-parallel-size-local 1`和`--tensor-"
"parallel-size 16`。这将创建1个本地DP组，每组TP16。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:621
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` define the DP "
"control plane."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-address`和`--data-parallel-rpc-port`定义DP控制平面。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:622
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is larger on the prefill node and smaller on the "
"decode node because prefill is prompt-token intensive while decode is "
"latency sensitive."
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens`在预填充节点上较大，在解码节点上较小，因为预填充是提示词令牌密集型，而解码对延迟敏感。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:623
msgid ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable` sends requests back to the prefill side to "
"recompute KV cache when decode KV cache is insufficient. Enable it only on "
"the decode node in PD mode."
msgstr ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable`在解码KV缓存不足时将请求发送回预填充端重新计算KV缓存。仅在PD模式下在解码节点上启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:624
msgid ""
"`--kv-transfer-config` sets the Mooncake connector. `kv_role` is "
"`kv_producer` on prefill and `kv_consumer` on decode."
msgstr ""
"`--kv-transfer-"
"config`设置Mooncake连接器。`kv_role`在prefill上为`kv_producer`，在decode上为`kv_consumer`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:625
msgid ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout."
msgstr ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size`和`decode.dp_size/tp_size`必须与实际全局DP和TP布局匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:626
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` disables prefix caching. For PD disaggregation,"
" the D-node prefix-cache known issue is tracked in "
"[#7944](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/7944)."
msgstr ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-"
"caching`禁用前缀缓存。对于PD分离，D节点前缀缓存的已知问题在[#7944](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/7944)中跟踪。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:627
msgid ""
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT` is the timeout in seconds for "
"automatically releasing the prefiller KV cache for a request."
msgstr "`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`是自动释放请求的prefiller KV缓存的超时时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:628
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` is "
"recommended on the decode node to reduce decode dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"建议在解码节点上使用`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`以减少解码调度开销。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:630
msgid "5.5 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (Ascend 950DT series)"
msgstr "5.5 预填充-解码分离（Ascend 950DT系列）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:632
msgid ""
"For Ascend 950DT (96GB x 8), we recommend deploying 1P1D with 2 nodes for "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`:"
msgstr ""
"对于Ascend 950DT（96GB x 8），我们建议使用2个节点部署1P1D以运行`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:634
msgid ""
"1 Prefill node: 1 Ascend 950DT (96GB x 8). Runs an independent service with "
"DP=1, TP=8."
msgstr "1个预填充节点：1个Ascend 950DT（96GB x 8）。以DP=1、TP=8运行独立服务。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:635
msgid ""
"1 Decode node: 1 Ascend 950DT (96GB x 8). Forms a global DP=1 group, with 1 "
"local DP rank (TP=8)."
msgstr "1个解码节点：1个Ascend 950DT（96GB x 8）。形成全局DP=1组，包含1个本地DP rank（TP=8）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:637
msgid ""
"The prefill service pushes KV cache to the decode node via the Mooncake p2p "
"connector."
msgstr "预填充服务通过Mooncake p2p连接器将KV缓存推送到解码节点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:641
msgid "5.5.1 Prefill Node"
msgstr "5.5.1 预填充节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:722
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the prefill service is not ready for a long time, "
"check whether `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` contains all 8 NPUs, the Mooncake "
"`kv_port` is available, and `ascend_local_comm_res_path` points to a "
"writable shared path."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果预填充服务长时间未就绪，请检查`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`是否包含全部8个NPU，Mooncake "
"`kv_port`是否可用，以及`ascend_local_comm_res_path`是否指向可写的共享路径。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:724
msgid "5.5.2 Decode Node"
msgstr "5.5.2 解码节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:805
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If decode node 0 fails to initialize, check that `--data-"
"parallel-start-rank` is 0, `--tensor-parallel-size` is 8, and "
"`kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size` matches the global decode DP size"
" (1)."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果解码节点0初始化失败，请检查`--data-parallel-start-rank`是否为0，`--tensor-parallel-"
"size`是否为8，以及`kv_connector_extra_config.decode.dp_size`是否与全局解码DP大小（1）匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:807
msgid "5.6 Request Forwarding"
msgstr "5.6 请求转发"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:809
msgid ""
"Run a proxy server on the same node as the prefiller service instance. You "
"can get the proxy program in the repository examples: "
"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)."
msgstr ""
"在与prefiller服务实例相同的节点上运行代理服务器。您可以在仓库示例中获取代理程序：[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:818
msgid ""
"For A3 PD disaggregation (1P1D), the proxy forwards requests to 1 prefill "
"node and 1 decode node. Use the layerwise proxy script."
msgstr "对于A3 PD分离（1P1D），代理将请求转发到1个预填充节点和1个解码节点。使用分层代理脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:833
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:845
msgid ""
"For Ascend 950DT PD disaggregation (1P1D), the proxy forwards requests to 1 "
"prefill node and 1 decode node. Use the layerwise proxy script."
msgstr "对于Ascend 950DT PD分离（1P1D），代理将请求转发到1个prefill节点和1个decode节点。请使用分层代理脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:862
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If requests reach the proxy but no output is returned, "
"check that the proxy host list includes all healthy prefill and decode "
"endpoints, and verify that the service verification request in Section 6 "
"succeeds through the proxy port."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果请求到达代理但未返回输出，请检查代理主机列表是否包含所有健康的prefill和解码端点，并验证第6节中的服务验证请求是否通过代理端口成功。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:864
msgid "6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "6 功能验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:866
msgid ""
"After the server is started, send a request to verify basic model "
"functionality. For single-node and MP deployment, use the API endpoint on "
"node 0. For PD disaggregation, use the proxy endpoint."
msgstr "服务器启动后，发送请求以验证基本模型功能。对于单节点和MP部署，使用节点0上的API端点。对于PD分离，使用代理端点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:879
msgid ""
"Expected result: the HTTP status is 200 and the JSON response contains a "
"`choices` field with generated text."
msgstr "预期结果：HTTP状态为200，JSON响应包含一个带有生成文本的`choices`字段。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:881
msgid "7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "7 精度评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:883
msgid "Here are two accuracy evaluation methods."
msgstr "以下是两种精度评估方法。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:885
msgid "7.1 Using AISBench"
msgstr "7.1 使用AISBench"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:887
msgid ""
"Refer to [Using "
"AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md) for details."
msgstr ""
"详情请参考[使用AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:888
msgid ""
"After execution, you can get the result. The following result of "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8` on `vllm-ascend:v0.17.0rc1` is for reference only."
msgstr ""
"执行后，您可以获得结果。以下`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8`在`vllm-ascend:v0.17.0rc1`上的结果仅供参考。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md:841
